  "title": "India-Uzbekistan and India-Uzbekistan Strategic Partnership Deepens",
  "summary": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi and President Shavkat Mirziyoyev of Uzbekistan held delegation-level talks to strengthen trade, defense, and energy cooperation, with the two countries aiming to further their shared developmental vision of 'Viksit Bharat' and 'Yangi Uzbekistan'. India's growing involvement in the Brics has expanded. The visit aims to strengthen India's strategic partnerships and deepen its engagement with Central Asia.",
