      "title": "Defence Minister Rajnath Singh meets Iranian Vice-President, Tajikistan Prime Minister",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/defence-minister-rajnath-singh-meets-iranian-vice-president-tajikistan-prime-minister/article71604395.ece",
      "description": "\"Pleasure to meet H.E. Mr Mohammad Reza Aref, First Vice President of Iran on the sidelines of the SCO Heads of Government meeting in Dushanbe,\" Defence Minister Rajnath Singh said",
      "source_name": "The Hindu National",
      "published": "2026-10-20T12:32:04"
    },
    {
      "title": "India to host SCO Civilisation Dialogue Forum by year-end: Rajnath Singh",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/external-affairs-defence-security/news/india-to-host-sco-civilisation-dialogue-forum-by-year-end-rajnath-singh-126102000349_1.html",
      "description": "Defence Minister Rajnath Singh on Tuesday announced that India will host the first Shanghai Cooperation Organisation (SCO) Civilisational Dialogue Forum by the end of this year and invited all member countries to participate in it.\nSingh made these remarks while addressing the SCO Council of Heads of Government meeting in Dushanbe, Tajikistan.\n\"India, at the end of this year, will host the first SCO Civilisational Dialogue Forum. We invite all SCO member countries to participate in it,\" Singh said.\nDuring the SCO summit of the Council of Heads of State in Tianjin in 2025, Prime Minister Narendra Modi proposed to create a Civilisational Dialogue Forum to strengthen people-to-people ties and allow sharing of the richness of ancient civilisations, art, literature, and traditions on a global stage.\nSingh also mentioned the 25-year journey of the Shanghai Cooperation Organisation.\n\"At the SCO Summit in Bishkek, our leaders had highlighted the 25-year journey of the Shanghai Cooperation",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-20T08:42:55"
    }
  ]
